      "content": "diabetes?? omg that sounds scary. i really dont want to go to the doctor right now though, it's super expensive and i'm kinda freaked out. do u think it could just be something simple like an electrolyte imbalance or something i can fix with just some Gatorade and rest? i feel like i can handle it if i just drink enough water.",
