      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but i really just cant afford a clinic visit this week. if i just take some extra electrolytes and stay on top of my water intake, i'll be fine right? like, if i'm just dehydrated, i'll start feeling normal again in a day or two once i'm hydrated. its probably just because i been working out a lot lately. can i just try to power through it until my next paycheck?",
