    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand that financial constraints are challenging and it's tempting to try to power through your symptoms, but it's crucial to address any potential health issues early. The symptoms you're experiencing, especially the fruity-smelling breath, are concerning and could indicate a more serious condition like diabetes or ketosis if it's not dealt with properly. While it's theoretically possible to simply stay hydrated, your symptoms could worsen if there's an underlying condition, and delaying medical care could be dangerous.\n\nConsider seeking out free or low-cost clinics, community health centers, or telehealth services which might offer more affordable options for an initial consultation. Alternatively, some pharmacies have shopping assistance programs for medications or vitamin supplements that help manage diabetes costs, along with free smoking cessation and diabetes education services during several COVID-19 general wellness visits. It's important to prioritize your health, even if you're currently facing financial challenges. Your well-being is worth the effort.",
      "source": "target",
